# Copy of r1031/c1_client.qb for run r1101 (2026-11-01): a tp to each row's build area is inserted before its first
# setblock / fill / summon (chunks there were not loaded in the client). World QA_A1 = r11p1 with the r1031 A1 look targets rebuilt.
# Run 2026-10-31, client block C1: a throwaway client (tools/perf/eval/eval_client.py, JFR on) in single player.
# World QA_A1 = copy of the A1 superflat world (tools/scratch_query/sp_world.py patches allowCommands). Run with
#   qrun.py client GAME tools/scratch_query/batches/r1031/c1_client.qb RES
# after the world is open (in game, no screen open). "> cmd" lines are typed into chat; "shot" takes a window
# screenshot into RES/shots/ for the agent to read. Look-at checks use tp facing so WTHIT shows the block.
# "hand:" in a look line = GUI steps (hover, JEI search, crafting) the agent does with xdotool and screenshots.
pace 2

## CQ-R31-BOOT | client boot and world join clean
bootexpect FIRST_CLIENT_TICK|Sound engine started
bootreject (Mixin apply failed|InvalidInjectionException).*(creativeengineering|creative_delight)
bootreject (?i)(FallingBlockWaterSplash|KettleScreenTankMixin|KettleJeiBaseMixin|WateringCanJeiPlugin|CropSeasonTooltip).*(error|fail)
kjsreject (?i)error occurred
> gamemode creative
> time set noon
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
shot joined

